# Docker build context — keep it to what the build actually needs.
#
# Both Dockerfiles COPY the repo root, because mcp/ bundles the takeoff engine
# out of web/src/lib at build time. The M0 Dockerfile also executes the web test
# and benchmark suites, so web/test and web/bench MUST remain in the context.

.git
.github
.gitignore

# Installed trees — every stage runs its own `npm ci`.
**/node_modules

# Build output — regenerated in the build stage.
**/dist
mcp/*.mcpb

# Fetched at deploy time by web/scripts/fetch-voice-model.mjs (~44 MB), never
# required by the M0 privacy gate.
web/public/models

# Docs/media and non-web fixtures: nothing in the M0 bundle imports them.
docs
demo
web/public/demo
capture
server
*.md
!mcp/README.md

# IMPORTANT: do not ignore web/test or web/bench. Dockerfile.m0 release-gates
# production on both. Excluding them previously caused `npm test` to run 0 tests
# and `npm run bench` to fail with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND.

# Local noise.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.log
